      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『我，能为后来者留下什么？』\n……今后，我想认真思考这个问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "337c05af24d1b09e45727ab750791ea53878ba590e2ca84b21dc329cb7bb051c",
