    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deae00e4a02c97990bd4eb24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和不再迷惘的空中救世主相互点头。\n在备战维多利亚英里赛，继续锻炼的同时\n……一起收集吧。收集她所说的『数据』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe40efb067f5ec012c5f8d89428115507422d1729c79020e16c2fc85e1414b43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
